# MiniLM model weights (~87 MB) downloaded by fastembed. `MiniLmProvider` points
# fastembed at the OS cache dir, but its default is a `.fastembed_cache` folder
# relative to the *current working directory* — so this still shows up if you run
# `av` or `cargo test` from a checkout before that override applies, or point
# FASTEMBED_CACHE_DIR somewhere inside the tree. Not anchored with a leading
# slash on purpose: a root-only rule leaves the per-crate copies unignored.
.fastembed_cache/
